      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RUPEE'S ROCKET (5) goes very well here starting nine times for six wins and two minors. Was out of placings last time (26.20) at Hobart in a Grade 4, finishing fifth and beaten 5.5 lengths. Looks well placed and should feature. IS IT ME (1) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish third (35.10) at this track in a Grade 4/5 over 600m. Expected to feature again. HIGHGATE PETE (8) drawn the outside box and could get a clear run. Was below best last time when 6th and beaten 7 lengths at Hobart (20.36). Form here at this distance is strong including two wins. Worth following up. AEROPLANE BERNIE (7) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
